                <title><![CDATA[【MASTER &amp; MASTER RIP】MASTER - Madonna - Sorry (Master Clean AAC 1000p)]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-sorry-master-clean-aac-1000p.306363/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<b>Thumbnail &amp; Screenshots:</b><br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/Txv8mjk4/2005-Sorry-Master-Clean-AAC-1000p-mp4.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/Txv8mjk4/2005-Sorry-Master-Clean-AAC-1000p-mp4.png" style=""><br>
<b><img src="https://i.ibb.co/FLcP2gQM/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h08m59s443.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/FLcP2gQM/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h08m59s443.png" style=""> <br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/LXK8QRq3/vlcsnap-2026-08-11-14h26m18s397.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/LXK8QRq3/vlcsnap-2026-08-11-14h26m18s397.png" style=""> <br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/Kxk6s7R7/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h20m20s194.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/Kxk6s7R7/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h20m20s194.png" style=""> <br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/whkdnHkP/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h21m54s453.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/whkdnHkP/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h21m54s453.png" style=""> <br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/CpK4Lcpn/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h24m26s242.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/CpK4Lcpn/vlcsnap-2025-12-26-20h24m26s242.png" style=""> </b><br>
<br>
This is the best master of the <i>Sorry</i> music video that I know of so far. Unlike the fake 576p ProRes master of <i>Sorry</i>, this version has the correct aspect ratio, accurate colors, higher resolution (1000p) and the proper audio. The fake ProRes master has a different audio, where Madonna says the line "Forgive me" at 3:08, but in the video she actually says it at 3:11, which makes it out of sync.<br>
<br>
Here's a comparison of the quality:<br>
<b><img src="https://i.ibb.co/ch5dCkzm/Unbenannt.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/ch5dCkzm/Unbenannt.png" style=""> </b><br>
